      {
        "n": "Normal Pleasure",
        "s": "2026-10-27T03:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-10-27T04:00:00Z",
        "d": "Eclectic picks in a guest hour from rising Melbourne club producer Normal Pleasure, playing everything from Merzbow to Modest Mouse. \n\"The mix in and of itself is not exactly what one would call impressive or technical or even good really but the premise is that i try with all my might to marry songs with looser relationships than just strictly the bpm or the key or whatever which hopefully yields something interesting even if thats the negative kind of interesting and not the positive. Also i kind of enjoy traditional radio format more than djing which is passively sort of presenting tracks that im into at the moment rather than trying to force a rhythmic narrative onto them. They have a narrative inherently and that narrative is my entire life’s worth of music discovery - ongoing\"",
        "j": null,
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/guests/episodes/normal-pleasure-27th-october-2026"
      },
